invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_point.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the digit a carry out of bit 383 makes is written as zero, so
  a scalar whose top bits are all set loses 2^384. bin/p384_equiv_test
  verifies signatures whose scalars are just under n and one whose top
  five bits are set.

--- old
    digits[SCALAR_BITS] = (int8_t)carry;
--- new
    digits[SCALAR_BITS] = 0;
